# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

build/
.vscode/

# --- Local LLM-assisted development artifacts -------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT tracked. These live on the developer machine only and must
# never be committed or pushed to a remote. They may be used freely in local
# SDD branches — just never `git add -f` them, or they land on origin again.
# (These were purged from main/development history on 2026-08-10.)
.claude/
docs/
scripts/
.understand-anything/
# Below were previously covered only by a machine-global gitignore, which does
# not travel with a clone — on any other machine they showed up as untracked.
.superpowers/
graphify-out/
upstream_repo/
.venv/

# Handoff
**/HANDOFF.md